{meta title='Sequence types', about='The first terms of three famous sequences, and one ended by stop - the term that reaches 100 included.'}
<p>Primes: {sequence prime, rows=10}{$prime} {/sequence}</p>
<p>Fibonacci: {sequence fibonacci, rows=10}{$fibonacci} {/sequence}</p>
<p>Triangular: {sequence triangular, rows=8}{$sequence} {/sequence}</p>
<p>Fibonacci, stop=100: {sequence fibonacci, stop=100}{$sequence} {/sequence}</p>
